      "en": "Part b: adding two 64-element vectors, with a scalar loop body of 8 instructions and 2 setup instructions. Count the scalar and the vector instructions. Part c: if 80 percent of a run vectorizes, 8 times faster, what is the overall speedup? Pause and work it out."
